    "Choose a finished Discussion or Action from the record list." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "从记录列表中选择一项已完成的讨论或操作。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose a named document configuration, then adjust line width, typography, and each semantic callout independently. Changes apply after saving; line width is shared by Review, Edit, and Source." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Choose a named document configuration, then adjust line width, typography, and each semantic callout independently. Changes apply after saving; line width is shared by Review, Edit, and Source."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "选择一项命名的文稿配置，然后分别调整行宽、排版和每种语义 Callout。保存后修改生效；审阅、编辑和源码模式共用行宽。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose a reading lead from an Analyze Research Record." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "从一条 Analyze 研究记录中选择一条阅读线索。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose one Triptych-wide rule for when Scholium asks before extending a Run's bounded write set. This choice never grants blanket writes and is not attached to a Skill or Agent." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "选择一项适用于整个脉络的规则，决定 Scholium 在扩展运行的有界写入集合前何时询问。此选择从不授予笼统写入权限，也不附属于某项技能或智能体。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose one complete, compatible Triptych-local Method. This changes only the current Triptych." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Choose one complete, compatible Triptych-local Method. This changes only the current Triptych."
