    "Method and Practice prose can guide scholarly work. It cannot change Platform Actions, Sessions, collaboration policy, bounded writes, exact revisions, conflicts, or recovery." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "方法与实践文本可以指导学术工作，但无法更改平台操作、会话、协作策略、有界写入、精确修订、冲突或恢复。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Method and Practice prose guides scholarly work. It cannot change Platform Action support, Session scope, collaboration policy, write authorization, exact revisions, conflicts, or recovery." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "方法与实践文本指导学术工作，但无法更改平台操作支持、会话范围、协作策略、写入授权、精确修订、冲突或恢复。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
