    "Profiles and Practices can shape scholarly work and truthful Result fields. They cannot change Platform Actions, Research Context ownership, Session lifetime, collaboration policy, a Bounded Write Set, exact revisions, conflicts, or recovery." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "配置与实践可塑造学术工作和如实的结果字段，但无法更改平台操作、研究上下文的归属、会话期限、协作策略、有界写入集合、精确修订、冲突或恢复。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Profiles define each Action's researcher-facing academic fields. Practices are exact Markdown linked from a primary Method; they guide research but never grant authority." : {
      "localizations" : {
