          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Scholium could not record the Critique request and could not restore the Critique file automatically. %@ Recovery also failed: %@ Restore the Before Agent Work checkpoint before continuing." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Scholium could not record the Critique request and could not restore the Critique file automatically. %@ Recovery also failed: %@ Restore the Before Agent Work checkpoint before continuing."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Scholium 无法记录评析请求，也无法自动恢复评析文件。%@ 恢复也失败：%@ 请先恢复“智能体工作前”恢复点，再继续。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Scholium could not save the current editor before opening this Action. %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Scholium could not save the current editor before opening this Action. %1$@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Scholium 无法在打开此操作前保存当前编辑器。%1$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Scholium could not verify the current Note and will not write it. %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Scholium 无法验证当前笔记，因此不会写入。%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Scholium could not verify the interrupted save candidates. Their exact bytes remain unchanged. %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Scholium 无法验证中断保存候选内容。其精确字节保持不变。%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Scholium creates one ordinary Markdown document. Link its title exactly from a primary Method to include it in Research Context." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Scholium 会创建一个普通 Markdown 文档。从主方法中精确链接其标题，即可将其纳入研究上下文。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Scholium creates one ordinary local folder and registers only this primary Markdown. It does not create a package, version, dependency graph, or resource manifest." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Scholium 会创建一个普通本地文件夹，并且只注册其中的主 Markdown。它不会创建软件包、版本、依赖图或资源清单。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Scholium does not claim that a multi-file operation is atomic across vaults or filesystems. These durable records identify what was restored and what still needs inspection." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Scholium does not claim that a multi-file operation is atomic across vaults or filesystems. These durable records identify what was restored and what still needs inspection."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Scholium 不保证跨研究库或文件系统的多文件操作具有原子性。这些持久记录会说明已恢复的内容以及仍需检查的内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Scholium first creates Before Restore. Files created after this checkpoint move to Trash; files changed, moved, or deleted are restored from the selected checkpoint." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Scholium first creates Before Restore. Files created after this checkpoint move to Trash; files changed, moved, or deleted are restored from the selected checkpoint."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Scholium 会先创建“恢复前”恢复点。在此恢复点之后创建的文件将移入纸篓；更改、移动或删除的文件将从所选恢复点恢复。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Scholium first saves every open editor, then restores only if this Note still has the expected revision. If the source changed, recovery stops and keeps the candidate." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Scholium 会先保存所有打开的编辑器，然后仅在此笔记仍为预期版本时恢复。若源文本已更改，恢复将停止并保留候选内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Scholium first saves every open editor, verifies that the candidate is still the canonical source, and then removes only its completed machine-local recovery record." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Scholium 会先保存所有打开的编辑器，确认候选内容仍是权威源文本，然后仅移除已完成的本机恢复记录。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Scholium found no matching derived issues. Timed dismissals return after %@; Leave Unchanged returns only for a later Material revision or when restored in Settings." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Scholium found no matching derived issues. Timed dismissals return after %@; Leave Unchanged returns only for a later Material revision or when restored in Settings."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Scholium 未发现匹配的派生问题。定时忽略的项目会在 %@ 后返回；“保持不变”仅会在材料出现后续修订或在设置中恢复时返回。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Scholium found no matching derived issues. Timed dismissals return after %arg; Leave Unchanged returns only for a later Material revision or when restored in Settings." : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Scholium found no matching derived issues. Timed dismissals return after %arg; Leave Unchanged returns only for a later Material revision or when restored in Settings."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Scholium 未发现匹配的派生问题。定时忽略的项目会在 %arg 后返回；“保持不变”仅会在材料出现后续修订或在设置中恢复时返回。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Scholium found the file at a new location but cannot safely determine which previous note it belongs to." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Scholium found the file at a new location but cannot safely determine which previous note it belongs to."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Scholium 在新位置找到了该文件，但无法安全地确定它属于哪个先前的笔记。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Scholium has already recorded a decision for this exact request." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Scholium has already recorded a decision for this exact request."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Scholium 已经为这一准确请求记录了决定。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Scholium kept the current editor open because an editor update did not reach the autosave mirror. The complete editor buffer was recovered; retry the save." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Scholium kept the current editor open because an editor update did not reach the autosave mirror. The complete editor buffer was recovered; retry the save."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Scholium 使当前编辑器保持打开状态，因为编辑器更新未到达自动保存镜像。完整的编辑器缓冲区已恢复；重试保存。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Scholium kept the current editor open because it could not retrieve the complete Markdown buffer." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Scholium kept the current editor open because it could not retrieve the complete Markdown buffer."
