    },
    "The initial object is authorized by the researcher's explicit Action. Every additional document remains an exact Run-local member with role, operation, expected revision or proven absence, expiry, conflict handling, and recovery. Safety checks protect research material and authorization; they do not inspect or monitor Agent behavior. Changing this preference cannot cancel an already submitted file transaction." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "初始对象由研究者明确选择操作而获准。每个额外文档仍是精确的运行本地成员，带有角色、操作、预期修订或已证明不存在、到期时间、冲突处理和恢复。安全检查保护研究材料与授权；它们不会检查或监控智能体行为。更改此偏好无法取消已经提交的文件事务。"
